<title>FINLAND: AAMULEHTI 8-MTH PROFIT UP 11 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>AAMULEHTI 8-MTH PROFIT UP 11 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-Aug, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	63 vs 57</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    6.41 vs 7.92</p>
<p> Diluted EPS (markka)		     5.03 vs 6.03</p>
<p> Net sales				   1,030 vs 941</p>
<p> Operating profit			     79 vs 82</p>
<p> Depreciation				  82  vs 72</p>
<p> Net financial items		 charge 16 vs 25 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 nil vs 32 gain</p>
<p> Taxes					    18 vs 2</p>
<p> Net profit				     45 vs 87</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	 42 vs 41 at end-1995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish media group is Aamulehti-Yhtyma.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
